    "paperFeatures": [
      ["diagnostic", "zone of indifference"],
      ["verdict", "near-contradiction"]
    ],
    "comment": "Good/bad leave a neutral gap (14a); MPAs do not — existential vs universal force clash. The page marks the example #? (the prose and footnote 6 call the mark ?#) for a near-contradictory effect.",
