    "source": {"bibkey": "beltrama-2025", "paperLabel": "(22a)"},
    "language": "stan1293",
    "primaryText": "Ok, this pizza is acceptable. But a pizza any worse than this one—even by just a tiny bit—wouldn't be acceptable.",
